# MaCSad read-only administrative areas

One parameterized panel owns the shared styling for the three information areas.

## Component InfoPanel (kicker: Text) and (heading: Text) and (description: Text) and (boundary: Text)
View:
    <section class="panel">
      <p class="kicker">{kicker}</p><h2>{heading}</h2>
      <p>{description}</p><div class="boundary">{boundary}</div>
    </section>
Style:
    .panel { max-width: 940px; padding: clamp(24px,4vw,42px); background: #fffdf8; border: 1px solid #d7d2c6; border-radius: 16px; }
    .kicker { margin: 0 0 9px; color: #146878; font: 800 11px/1 ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: .15em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    h2 { margin: 0 0 12px; color: #123342; font: 750 30px/1.1 Georgia, serif; }
    p { color: #5e6c73; line-height: 1.7; }
    .boundary { margin-top: 22px; padding: 16px; color: #3d4c55; background: #f2efe6; border-left: 3px solid #16758a; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; }

## Component OrganizationPanel
View:
    <InfoPanel kicker="Virtual organization" heading="Roles and responsibilities"
      description="Actors, role assignments, handoffs, and escalation paths belong here. This preview is read-only."
      boundary="Actor creation, role changes, and delegation are not available in this preview."
    />

## Component ResearchPanel
View:
    <InfoPanel kicker="Discovery record" heading="Claims travel with evidence."
      description="Problems, conjectures, experiments, proof attempts, artifacts, and review decisions form the research record."
      boundary="This preview does not start research runs or publish results."
    />

## Component OperationsPanel
View:
    <InfoPanel kicker="System truth" heading="Research operations"
      description="Worker leases, delivery, budgets, and publication batches will report their saved state here."
      boundary="Only the gateway connection check is live in this preview."
    />
